# API Endpoint Testing

## Authentication

### Login
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "YOUR_EMAIL",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}
```

### Get Current User
```http
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
```

### Logout
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/logout
```

## Reports

### List Reports
```http
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?status=Sent
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?search=SK-2026
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31&type=Missing&page=1&pageSize=20
```

### Get Report by ID
```http
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1
```

### Create Report
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "IST001",
  "type": "Missing",
  "tplNo": "TPL20260131002",
  "waybillNo": "WB999999",
  "shipmentDate": "2026-01-31",
  "notes": "Test report",
  "items": [
    {
      "productNo": "PRD001",
      "productName": "Test Product",
      "qty": 5
    }
  ]
}
```

### Update Report
```http
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reports/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "IST001",
  "type": "Missing",
  "tplNo": "TPL20260131001",
  "waybillNo": "WB888888",
  "shipmentDate": "2026-01-31",
  "notes": "Updated notes",
  "items": [
    {
      "productNo": "PRD004",
      "productName": "Ürün D",
      "qty": 15
    }
  ]
}
```

### Send Report
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/3/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sendViaSmtp": false
}
```

### Accept Report
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1/accept
```

### Reject Report
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejectionReason": "Fotoğraf eksik",
  "note": "Lütfen hasar fotoğraflarını ekleyin"
}
```

### Revise and Resend
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/2/revise-resend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sendViaSmtp": false
}
```

### Close Report
```http
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/1/close
```
